```sql
DELIMITER //
CREATE PROCEDURE baiki_harga()
BEGIN
  DECLARE siap BOOL DEFAULT FALSE;
  DECLARE id_b INT; DECLARE h DECIMAL(10,2);
  DECLARE c CURSOR FOR SELECT id, harga FROM produk WHERE harga < 0;
  DECLARE CONTINUE HANDLER FOR NOT FOUND SET siap = TRUE;
  OPEN c;
  gelung: LOOP
    FETCH c INTO id_b, h;
    IF siap THEN LEAVE gelung; END IF;
    UPDATE produk SET harga = ABS(h) WHERE id = id_b;
  END LOOP;
  CLOSE c;
END //
DELIMITER ;
CALL baiki_harga();
```
Cursor untuk migrasi prosedural sekali-lalu (bukan logik app harian!). Handler NOT FOUND tamatkan; DELIMITER ubah semasa cipta. Uji atas salinan dahulu.

```sql
CREATE TABLE tetapan (
  skop VARCHAR(50) PRIMARY KEY,
  data JSON NOT NULL,
  CHECK (JSON_VALID(data))
);
INSERT INTO tetapan VALUES ('app', '{"tema": "gelap", "had": 100}');
SELECT data->>'$.tema' AS tema FROM tetapan WHERE skop = 'app';
UPDATE tetapan SET data = JSON_SET(data, '$.had', 200) WHERE skop = 'app';
CREATE INDEX idx_had ON tetapan ((CAST(data->>'$.had' AS UNSIGNED)));
```
JSON untuk fleksibel, lajur generated + indeks untuk yang disoal kerap. CHECK sahkan struktur; laluan panas (`WHERE had > x`) dapat lajur generated berindeks, bukan scan JSON.

