SELECT emel, COUNT(*) AS n FROM pengguna GROUP BY emel HAVING n > 1;
-- padam kekalkan terkecil (transaksi!):
START TRANSACTION;
DELETE a FROM pengguna a JOIN pengguna b
  ON a.emel = b.emel AND a.id > b.id;
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM pengguna; -- semak sebelum COMMIT
COMMIT;
```
Cari dahulu (GROUP+HAVING), padam self-join kekalkan id terkecil, semak kiraan sebelum COMMIT. Sandaran sebelum operasi, UNIQUE selepas (hentikan ulangan).

